                         names).

           _N_A_N_O___S_R_C      Path to the source tree used to build the image.

           _N_A_N_O___K_E_R_N_E_L   Name of the kernel configuration file used to build
                         the kernel.

           _N_A_N_O___A_R_C_H     Machine processor architecture to build.  Defaults to
                         output of uunnaammee --pp.

           _N_A_N_O___B_O_O_T_0_C_F_G
                         Controls the options passed to boot0cfg(8); these
                         dictate bboooott00's behaviour.

           _N_A_N_O___B_O_O_T_L_O_A_D_E_R
                         The bboooott00 loader to use relative to the _N_A_N_O___W_O_R_L_D_D_I_R
                         variable.  This defaults to _b_o_o_t_/_b_o_o_t_0_s_i_o and should
                         be overridden to _b_o_o_t_/_b_o_o_t_0 to provide a VGA console.

           _C_O_N_F___B_U_I_L_D    Options passed to the bbuuiillddwwoorrlldd stage of the build.

           _C_O_N_F___I_N_S_T_A_L_L  Options passed to the iinnssttaallllwwoorrlldd stage of the
